nox      dev_pckbc.c stub `x++' deleted (ALREADY BUILT)               150/150   none -- the PIT channel is INDEPENDENT
                                                                                 of the 8042 stub oracle
cdxZL3   post-store read iff lane 3 && data[ofs]==0 (BUILT)           150/150   none -- NO lca access in this session
                                                                                 reaches lane 3, and lane 3 (port 0x43)
                                                                                 has no counter.  THE LIMIT, MEASURED.
