                                                                                 x 4 widths x 2 data + all 4 tails x 2
Wpure    write arm's `return' removed = x_wfallthru (BUILT)            86/150   IDENTICAL set to WWall -- the store-side
                                                                                 channel is DIRECTION-BLIND by design
WWtail   store dup at len 3/5/6/7 (BUILT)                             134/150   all 16 TAIL PS rows; direct green
WW6      store dup at len 6 only (BUILT)                              146/150   tail6 PS x 2 data x 2 rows = 4
dNZtail  x_wfallthru gated (tail width AND byte != 0) (BUILT)         142/150   tail PS at X=0x5a only, 4 tails x 2 = 8;
